ed club presidents\",\"qty\":40,\"unit_cost\":150,\"total\":6000}]',35000.00,32000.00,NULL,'Pending Admin',58,'Institutional student governance summit logistics. SSC endorsed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-18 01:57:17','2026-10-18 05:15:27',NULL),(28,19,'Youth Mental Health Awareness Kits & Resource Speaker Honorarium','Psychological first aid brochures, self-care kits, and accredited clinical speaker fee.','[{\"item\":\"Student Wellness & Mindfulness Care Kits\",\"description\":\"Stress relief journals, hotline cards, and ribbons\",\"qty\":200,\"unit_cost\":35,\"total\":7000},{\"item\":\"Licensed Clinical Psychologist Honorarium\",\"description\":\"Keynote speaker fee for Mental Health Week\",\"qty\":1,\"unit_cost\":3500,\"total\":3500},{\"item\":\"Peer Counseling Booth Tarpaulins & Forms\",\"description\":\"Intake sheets and privacy partition banners\",\"qty\":3,\"unit_cost\":500,\"total\":1500}]',12000.00,NULL,NULL,'Pending SSC',1,'Adviser endorsed. Submitted to SSC Executive Committee for review.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-18 01:57:17','2026-10-18 05:15:27',NULL),(29,3,'Robotics Tournament Microcontroller Kits & Actuator Parts','Procurement of sensor arrays, motor controllers, and development boards for ACES challenge.','[{\"item\":\"ESP32 & Arduino Mega Development Kits\",\"description\":\"Microcontroller boards with ultrasonic & IR sensors\",\"qty\":10,\"unit_cost\":950,\"total\":9500},{\"item\":\"High-Torque Servo Motors & LiPo Battery Packs\",\"description\":\"Actuators and rechargeable power cells for line-followers\",\"qty\":10,\"unit_cost\":450,\"total\":4500},{\"item\":\"Robotics Arena Track Mat & Obstacle Walls\",\"description\":\"Vinyl printed competition arena track\",\"qty\":1,\"unit_cost\":2000,\"total\":2000}]',16000.00,NULL,NULL,'Pending SSC',1,'Submitted by ACES Executive Board. Endorsed by Adviser Elena Ramos.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-18 01:57:17','2026-10-18 05:15:27',NULL),(30,82,'BSIT Cybersecurity & Cloud Defense Workshop Lab Kits','Hardware security keys, packet sniffing lab adapters, and guest speaker honorarium for BSIT summit.','[{\"item\":\"Dual-Band Packet Injection Wireless Adapters\",\"description\":\"Cybersecurity defensive lab exercises\",\"qty\":15,\"unit_cost\":800,\"total\":12000},{\"item\":\"Certified Ethical Hacker Speaker Honorarium\",\"description\":\"Industry keynote speaker token and plaque\",\"qty\":2,\"unit_cost\":3500,\"total\":7000},{\"item\":\"Printed Lab Manuals & Reference Guides\",\"description\":\"Spiral-bound network defense workbooks\",\"qty\":100,\"unit_cost\":45,\"total\":4500}]',23500.00,23500.00,23500.00,'Disbursed',118,'Approved & Disbursed by System Admin: Lab equipment logged in IT inventory.','2026-10-02 02:15:00','CHK-2026-0064',59,'2026-10-18 05:15:27','2026-10-18 05:15:27',NULL),(31,7,'Forensic Ballistics & Crime Scene Investigation Field Kit','Latent fingerprint dusting powders, evidence markers, barrier tapes, and UV inspection lamps.','[{\"item\":\"Magnetic Latent Fingerprint Powder Kits\",\"description\":\"Forensic lab demonstration kits with brushes\",\"qty\":10,\"unit_cost\":950,\"total\":9500},{\"item\":\"Numbered Crime Scene Evidence Tents & Tapes\",\"description\":\"Acrylic photo markers (1-50) and perimeter rolls\",\"qty\":5,\"unit_cost\":1100,\"total\":5500},{\"item\":\"Forensic UV Light Sources & Protective Goggles\",\"description\":\"Trace evidence detection tools\",\"qty\":6,\"unit_cost\":800,\"total\":4800}]',19800.00,19000.00,19000.00,'Disbursed',23,'SSC vetted at ₱19,000.00. Disbursed by Accounting for Criminology Week.','2026-10-05 07:20:00','CHK-2026-0071',59,'2026-10-18 05:15:27','2026-10-18 05:15:27',NULL),(32,9,'Inter-Collegiate Athletics Conditioning & First Aid Gear','Agility ladders, digital stopwatches, sports hydration coolers, and elastic kinesiology tapes.','[{\"item\":\"Speed & Agility Training Ladders + Cones\",\"description\":\"Varsity & PE conditioning equipment set\",\"qty\":6,\"unit_cost\":1200,\"total\":7200},{\"item\":\"Insulated 20