um cash advance for miscellaneous drum and lyre expenses without supplier quotes.','[{\"item\":\"Miscellaneous Contingency Cash Advance\",\"description\":\"Unitemized operational buffer\",\"qty\":1,\"unit_cost\":15000,\"total\":15000}]',15000.00,NULL,NULL,'Rejected',50,'Rejected by Admin: All requisitions must contain specific line-item quantities and unit costs. Lump-sum cash advances are not permitted.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-18 05:15:27','2026-10-18 05:15:27',NULL);
