urce projects and deeper understanding of industry-standard software engineering.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"scheduling_insights\": \"All proposed dates strategically avoid BCP\'s midterm and final examination weeks as well as national regular and special non-working holidays. Scheduling events on Friday afternoons and Saturday mornings maximizes student attendance without disrupting regular academic classes.\"\n}','Generative AI Engine','2026-10-18 06:29:31');
